{"type":"message","id":"21e5ad8f","parentId":"f247ef29","timestamp":"2026-03-12T07:38:34.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 对，你理解得很准。  \n简单说就是：\n\n- 你把旧 skill 挪到了：`skills/legacy/web-unit-testbook`\n- 但 `testbook` agent 还在按老地址找：`skills/web-unit-testbook`\n\n所以它现在会“按旧地址去找，找不到”。\n\n你可以把它理解成：  \n**agent 的通讯录还没更新，联系人搬家了。**\n\n要修很简单，我推荐最稳的做法：  \n- 在 `skills/` 根下补一个“门牌”（链接）`web-unit-testbook` → 指向 `legacy/web-unit-testbook`  \n这样旧调用不改、马上恢复可用。\n\n你点头我就直接给你修好。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04b3aff31f5951c40169b26d7442208191920090cb5382d641\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":35230,"output":168,"cacheRead":2560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37958,"cost":{"input":0.0616525,"output":0.002352,"cacheRead":0.000448,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0644525}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773301106702}}
