{"type":"message","id":"dda79525","parentId":"3dca9fc7","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:49:09.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_OMDHFTJ5fk7vtS51E2mcvJXH|fc_01e6cd9c3e16fed70169b2b63d4b6481919cab89773d4b9b63","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace-testbook\\skills\\multiskill\\utb-code-enricher\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: utb-code-enricher\ndescription: 提取LWC/Apex逻辑并与设计规则合并。Use when user needs branch conditions, API behavior, required/format checks, and error-message expectations from code.\n---\n\n# UTB Code Enricher / 代码规则增强\n\nCombine design and implementation logic.\n融合设计规则与实现逻辑。\n\n## Inputs / 输入\n- `design_enriched.json`\n- code zip/folder（代码压缩包或目录）\n\n## Output / 输出\nWrite `merged_rules.json` including / 生成 `merged_rules.json`，至少包含：\n- `ui_actions_with_code_links`\n- `server_validations`\n- `api_calls`\n- `branch_conditions`\n- `error_messages`\n\n## Rules / 规则\n- Keep file path + line references for every inferred rule.\n- 每条规则都要保留文件路径与行号。\n- If design and code conflict, record both and mark confidence.\n- 设计与代码冲突时并存记录并标注置信度。\n- Prefer deterministic extraction over free-form summarization.\n- 优先确定性抽取，避免自由发挥式总结。\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace-testbook\\\\skills\\\\multiskill\\\\utb-code-enricher\\\\SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: utb-code-enricher\\ndescription: 提取LWC/Apex逻辑并与设计规则合并。Use when user needs branch conditions, API behavior, required/format checks, and error-message expectations from code.\\n---\\n\\n# UTB Code Enricher / 代码规则增强\\n\\nCombine design and implementation logic.\\n融合设计规则与实现逻辑。\\n\\n## Inputs / 输入\\n- `design_enriched.json`\\n- code zip/folder（代码压缩包或目录）\\n\\n## Output / 输出\\nWrite `merged_rules.json` including / 生成 `merged_rules.json`，至少包含：\\n- `ui_actions_with_code_links`\\n- `server_validations`\\n- `api_calls`\\n- `branch_conditions`\\n- `error_messages`\\n\\n## Rules / 规则\\n- Keep file path + line references for every inferred rule.\\n- 每条规则都要保留文件路径与行号。\\n- If design and code conflict, record both and mark confidence.\\n- 设计与代码冲突时并存记录并标注置信度。\\n- Prefer deterministic extraction over free-form summarization.\\n- 优先确定性抽取，避免自由发挥式总结。\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1040,"output":323,"cacheRead":40448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41811,"cost":{"input":0.00182,"output":0.004522,"cacheRead":0.0070783999999999994,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013420399999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319740722}}
