{"type":"message","id":"2a994294","parentId":"e5bdb764","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:49:16.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_K6e1chD7Cilx562Z9LhKPipj|fc_01e6cd9c3e16fed70169b2b644c27081918be880559e7b4773","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace-testbook\\skills\\multiskill\\utb-template-parser\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: utb-template-parser\ndescription: 解析现有单体测试书Excel模板并建立严格列映射。Use when identifying target sheets, header rows, required columns, and fill rules such as operation steps, test conditions, expected results, and step numbering.\n---\n\n# UTB Template Parser / 模板解析\n\nUnderstand template structure before generation.\n在生成前先理解模板结构。\n\n## Output / 输出\nWrite `template_schema.json` with / 生成 `template_schema.json`，包含：\n- `target_sheet`\n- `header_row`\n- `column_map`\n- `required_columns`\n- `step_numbering_rules`\n- `merge_cell_rules`\n\n## Rules / 规则\n- Detect Japanese headers (e.g., 画面操作手順, テスト条件, 想定結果).\n- 识别日文表头（如 画面操作手順、テスト条件、想定結果）。\n- Reject export when required columns are missing.\n- 缺少必填列时禁止导出。\n- Keep exact column letters/indexes for exporter.\n- 保留精确列字母/索引供导出器使用。\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace-testbook\\\\skills\\\\multiskill\\\\utb-template-parser\\\\SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: utb-template-parser\\ndescription: 解析现有单体测试书Excel模板并建立严格列映射。Use when identifying target sheets, header rows, required columns, and fill rules such as operation steps, test conditions, expected results, and step numbering.\\n---\\n\\n# UTB Template Parser / 模板解析\\n\\nUnderstand template structure before generation.\\n在生成前先理解模板结构。\\n\\n## Output / 输出\\nWrite `template_schema.json` with / 生成 `template_schema.json`，包含：\\n- `target_sheet`\\n- `header_row`\\n- `column_map`\\n- `required_columns`\\n- `step_numbering_rules`\\n- `merge_cell_rules`\\n\\n## Rules / 规则\\n- Detect Japanese headers (e.g., 画面操作手順, テスト条件, 想定結果).\\n- 识别日文表头（如 画面操作手順、テスト条件、想定結果）。\\n- Reject export when required columns are missing.\\n- 缺少必填列时禁止导出。\\n- Keep exact column letters/indexes for exporter.\\n- 保留精确列字母/索引供导出器使用。\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1411,"output":318,"cacheRead":40448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42177,"cost":{"input":0.00246925,"output":0.004452,"cacheRead":0.0070783999999999994,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013999649999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319749732}}
