{"type":"message","id":"26d9e657","parentId":"88002e11","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:49:25.090Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_x1GcXyWrYDQYKi3Q3EJxPjpp|fc_01e6cd9c3e16fed70169b2b64cffec8191ba6549437a81490e","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace-testbook\\skills\\multiskill\\utb-case-generator\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: utb-case-generator\ndescription: 从合并后的设计+代码规则和模板Schema生成标准化测试用例。Use when building step-by-step operations, test conditions, expected results, normal/error branches, and stable case IDs.\n---\n\n# UTB Case Generator / 用例生成\n\nCreate template-ready case objects.\n生成可直接落模板的用例对象。\n\n## Inputs / 输入\n- `merged_rules.json`\n- `template_schema.json`\n\n## Output / 输出\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n\n## Rules / 规则\n- Generate both normal and abnormal scenarios.\n- 生成正常与异常场景两类用例。\n- Keep step order contiguous (`1..N`) per scenario.\n- 每个场景内步骤必须连续编号（`1..N`）。\n- Emit explicit fields aligned with template columns.\n- 输出字段必须与模板列一一对齐。\n- Include source trace (design row / code line) per case.\n- 每条用例都要带来源追溯（设计行/代码行）。\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace-testbook\\\\skills\\\\multiskill\\\\utb-case-generator\\\\SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: utb-case-generator\\ndescription: 从合并后的设计+代码规则和模板Schema生成标准化测试用例。Use when building step-by-step operations, test conditions, expected results, normal/error branches, and stable case IDs.\\n---\\n\\n# UTB Case Generator / 用例生成\\n\\nCreate template-ready case objects.\\n生成可直接落模板的用例对象。\\n\\n## Inputs / 输入\\n- `merged_rules.json`\\n- `template_schema.json`\\n\\n## Output / 输出\\n- `cases.json`\\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\\n\\n## Rules / 规则\\n- Generate both normal and abnormal scenarios.\\n- 生成正常与异常场景两类用例。\\n- Keep step order contiguous (`1..N`) per scenario.\\n- 每个场景内步骤必须连续编号（`1..N`）。\\n- Emit explicit fields aligned with template columns.\\n- 输出字段必须与模板列一一对齐。\\n- Include source trace (design row / code line) per case.\\n- 每条用例都要带来源追溯（设计行/代码行）。\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":751,"output":300,"cacheRead":41472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42523,"cost":{"input":0.0013142499999999999,"output":0.0042,"cacheRead":0.0072575999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01277185}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319756845}}
