{"type":"message","id":"6a12be20","parentId":"d6404eee","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:49:32.576Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_uEaG19YviOgGuhMjqyKPIqhb|fc_01e6cd9c3e16fed70169b2b65482508191815b2bc3eeae423d","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace-testbook\\skills\\multiskill\\utb-excel-exporter\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: utb-excel-exporter\ndescription: 按严格Schema映射将生成用例写入目标测试书Excel模板。Use when exporting final deliverables while preserving template layout, merged cells, and formatting constraints.\n---\n\n# UTB Excel Exporter / Excel导出\n\nExport final workbook from generated cases.\n将生成用例导出为最终工作簿。\n\n## Inputs / 输入\n- `template.xlsx`\n- `template_schema.json`\n- `cases.json`\n\n## Output / 输出\n- `unit_test_book_generated.xlsx`\n- `export_report.json`\n\n## Rules / 规则\n- Preserve original workbook style and non-target sheets.\n- 保留原有样式及非目标sheet不变。\n- Apply step/condition/expected-result mapping exactly.\n- 严格按步骤/条件/预期结果映射写入。\n- Validate required columns and non-empty mandatory cells.\n- 校验必填列与必填单元格非空。\n- Emit export report (filled rows, skipped rows, warnings).\n- 输出导出报告（写入行、跳过行、告警）。\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace-testbook\\\\skills\\\\multiskill\\\\utb-excel-exporter\\\\SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: utb-excel-exporter\\ndescription: 按严格Schema映射将生成用例写入目标测试书Excel模板。Use when exporting final deliverables while preserving template layout, merged cells, and formatting constraints.\\n---\\n\\n# UTB Excel Exporter / Excel导出\\n\\nExport final workbook from generated cases.\\n将生成用例导出为最终工作簿。\\n\\n## Inputs / 输入\\n- `template.xlsx`\\n- `template_schema.json`\\n- `cases.json`\\n\\n## Output / 输出\\n- `unit_test_book_generated.xlsx`\\n- `export_report.json`\\n\\n## Rules / 规则\\n- Preserve original workbook style and non-target sheets.\\n- 保留原有样式及非目标sheet不变。\\n- Apply step/condition/expected-result mapping exactly.\\n- 严格按步骤/条件/预期结果映射写入。\\n- Validate required columns and non-empty mandatory cells.\\n- 校验必填列与必填单元格非空。\\n- Emit export report (filled rows, skipped rows, warnings).\\n- 输出导出报告（写入行、跳过行、告警）。\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1097,"output":311,"cacheRead":41472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42880,"cost":{"input":0.00191975,"output":0.004354,"cacheRead":0.0072575999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01353135}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319765096}}
