{"type":"message","id":"f03fddf8","parentId":"39bda069","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:33:14.700Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_lGaXuUXdOCn0pHPV2PpJOOvj|fc_08d5a571177417760169b2c09800c88191b3777316b1be72e4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: utb-orchestrator\ndescription: 端到端编排单体测试书生成流程（设计Excel+图片/检查单、LWC/Apex代码、测试书模板）。Use when user asks for one-shot generation, stage-by-stage traceability, multi-skill coordination, or rerun with the same run_id.\n---\n\n# UTB Orchestrator / 单体测试书总编排\n\nRun the pipeline in strict order and keep all artifacts under one run folder.\n按固定顺序执行流水线，所有产物归档到同一个 run 目录。\n\n## Inputs / 输入\n- `design.xlsx`\n- `code.zip` (or code folder / 或代码目录)\n- `template.xlsx`\n\n## Execution Order / 执行顺序\n1. `utb-design-parser` -> `design_core.json`\n2. `utb-image-checksheet-parser` -> `design_enriched.json`\n3. `utb-code-enricher` -> `merged_rules.json`\n4. `utb-template-parser` -> `template_schema.json`\n5. `utb-case-generator` -> `cases.json`, `UnitTestSpec.md`\n6. `utb-excel-exporter` -> `unit_test_book_generated.xlsx`\n\n## Required Checks / 必做校验\n- Validate all required columns in template schema before export.\n- 导出前必须校验模板必填列完整性。\n- Fail fast if sheet mapping is ambiguous.\n- 当 sheet 映射不唯一时立即失败。\n- Keep `run_manifest.json` with input hashes and output paths.\n- 保留 `run_manifest.json`（输入哈希 + 输出路径）。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773322394680}}
