{"type":"message","id":"f5613dd7","parentId":"53038226","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:36:30.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Confirming completion and files used**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01293a318173f9bc0169b2c156845c81919935e6e08d53b49e\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpssFXve035i7Urbsoz-Cn2BY4rfaMoadM0yBv3L5IRI3RFTBoDfP7LGhXED2wfaqGnxDk5hQEQwEJqEuGa77hU32WMASfqjGJShxzT80JjALuRE8LO3frArt_d4-4xc6zG7-83NDvAp5iCUV8FcUqVdCdb-_Jl1fL8s54Xsp2-ZGi6PO9rc0w_zd_lto8CF0hPQP2YeiJEXmtQBBbgoZecvzJ6nnolSrppFdAJfoe7AK9r0Y1proNrOaw4Z0Rs8m61ROGF7chbiUlCQY5AADRNIeGFlWRSGeMKyilwID7GKwOXFEaHcfyEFKpScAv1pTjXLlVzZWuxC9A_y9Rmf4m5kmtVt0oATQ1H4X2Pb7zjrVK1v4We2cP6z3SXFU61I98c48FBHWfvE0bNwXJm-EPTXQls5e1Tx5jiMZSOoes1XanIkCLCogE26Ud1_Yqq8XlgfNQz8F3bnY0w9OybtJ6rz7BCQf-bJ03Y3L0yHFl4a1FW91DxUOFoK-9ODc46MRlIKaIz4htPCClGX3my68zvnTcZXfnHJK3KMkGVr6NgxdY9GytW6cSlet8XJYo1ir7ydyUzE5yJhCKYqKPed0nKFrx4mrg0A42qiIv5hVO0GJLvfJWEFugX0FN9KJfzcrEAHNl8dKpk4RaUc3_oNm_uz54yyGiq_cxBCjTrsmrqXbIf9-v7ci3EFof0vIa5WA5QPoU-V5F3xDq8zKgHFGF_vV0v_OkdMoHvWperYlPa0zNt1ZtSIDFXAe6ETD_pXCknh7loHPwjhEar2wUEYMZ0b3JnxgxZ-W1QFgTSPXbhvFGFYrxFQ1OpkShzUyzboIEYMpRIq9z41jEw_L3BbYYrHED8LkcrAfG7kzS2YAMlNnj0d_ZbBeJuvDX04Uzsbnh1PlQAoJPL0RuVr1clyNgnHcST8SrpylrHpKZAStKX7s9mhNX4Xh-oEipJx7d96WzwbwA-WkBTCxPpxO9cOY9ntX3-AKesOf6D1cAyxlsQbJXXynz3OeKJBkrGoUEhfL0jrCM\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Confirming completion and files used**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好的，我已经帮你直接生成了（未改代码，只跑了现有流程）✅\n\n本次使用的 3 个输入（都在 `C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw`）：\n- 设计书：较大的 `.xlsx`（约 2.55MB）\n- 模板：较小的 `.xlsx`（约 25KB）\n- 代码包：`documentsResendFormConfirm.zip`\n\n生成结果目录：\n`C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace-testbook\\skills\\legacy\\web-unit-testbook\\workspace\\runs\\run-20260312-223601-auto`\n\n你重点看这个文件就行：\n- `unit_test_book_v3_template_based.xlsx`  ← 生成好的单体测试书\n\n同时也有中间产物：\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json`\n- `cases.json`（共识别到约 31 条 case）\n- `UnitTestSpec_UIOnly.md`\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以把这个最终 `.xlsx` 复制到 `C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\` 根目录，方便你直接拿。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01293a318173f9bc0169b2c157f1fc8191a96c09df13607141\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":183,"output":295,"cacheRead":96768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97246,"cost":{"input":0.00032025,"output":0.00413,"cacheRead":0.0169344,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021384649999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773322582413}}
