ctor --fix\n```\n\n尤其你这边有 cron/多 agent/多渠道，跑一下更稳。  \n你要我现在就帮你执行内置升级流程（`update.run`）的话，我可以直接开始。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a0863b3430b87310169b2cb4114748191b18ad8e5a2c75baf\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":3397,"output":316,"cacheRead":52864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56577,"cost":{"input":0.0059447499999999995,"output":0.004424,"cacheRead":0.0092512,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019619949999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773325121456}}
